                    <div class="card-title" style="margin-bottom:12px; color:#10b981;">💾 Data Pipeline Export & Migration</div>
                    <p style="font-size:13px; color:#94a3b8; margin-bottom:14px;">Export raw or filtered records directly to analytical JSON or CSV. Zero external ETL drivers required.</p>
                    <div style="display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:10px; margin-bottom:14px;">
                        <button onclick="exportJSON()" class="btn-primary" style="background:#0284c7;">📥 Export Complete AayuDB Database (JSON)</button>
                        <button onclick="exportDataCSV()" class="btn-primary" style="background:#10b981;">📊 Export Telemetry Dataset (CSV)</button>
                        <button onclick="downloadMyProfileJSON()" class="btn-primary" style="background:#7c3aed;">👤 Export Active User Profile (JSON)</button>
                    </div>
                    <div style="background:#030712; padding:12px; border-radius:8px; font-size:11px; color:#64748b;">
                        Enterprise Note: AayuDB auto-syncs with SQLite on disk and maintains a local append-only Write-Ahead Log (<code style="color:#cbd5e1;">aayudb_wal.json</code>).
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Ingested Dataset Table -->
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-header">
                    <div class="card-title"><span>📋</span> Real In-Memory Enterprise Ingestion Feed (Live Buffer)</div>
                    <span class="badge badge-engineer" id="feedCounterBadge">Showing 6 Records</span>
                </div>
                <div class="table-responsive">
                    <table>
                        <thead>
                            <tr>
                                <th>Transaction ID</th>
                                <th>Timestamp</th>
                                <th>Partition Node</th>
                                <th>User / Producer</th>
